<title>JAPAN: Jamco -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Jamco -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.29		vs	   10.91</p>
<p> Operating	  191    million	  vs	  609    million</p>
<p> Current	    157    million	  vs	  589    million</p>
